# battery_emergency_takeoff_floor.expect — the EMERGENCY on the floor in TAKEOFF cuts the motors; no LANDING, the craft stays on the floor
# TAKEOFF の床の上の EMERGENCY はモータを止める。LANDING にならず、機体は床の上のまま
#
exit 0
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Battery emergency in TAKEOFF without evidence of the air"
log_contains any "DISARM accepted (TAKEOFF → IDLE_GROUND)"
log_contains any "Transition: TAKEOFF → IDLE_GROUND"
log_absent any "Battery emergency → LANDING"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → LANDING"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Battery emergency in TAKEOFF without evidence of the air"
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 7.0 16.0
metric duty_max < 0.01 in 8.5 16.0
